      "role": "user",
      "content": "i think my credit union is trying to push me out of my account. it started with a few weirdly timed service fees and then a couple of my grocery transactions just got declined for no reason even though i have money. it feels too calculated to be a mistake. can you help me figure out what kind of defensive moves i should make so they don't finish whatever they're doing?",
