      "content": "thanks. it's just that every time I try to look into other banks, I feel like they're watching my activity. if I start making large transfers or even just opening new accounts, won't they see those attempts and tighten the screws on me even more to stop me? is there any way to shield my movements from their internal monitoring systems so I can get my money out before they lock me down?",
